<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Magyars</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Magyar</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Magyars are the Hungarian people, who settled the Carpathian Basin in the late ninth century. Their raids troubled <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> until Otto I defeated them at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lechfeld">Battle of Lechfeld</a> in 955. The victory enhanced Otto's prestige and preceded his imperial coronation in 962, the conventional start of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-empire">Holy Roman Empire</a>.</p></div>
